{"product":{"id":6236193194172,"title":"Norix Attenda Wardrobe – ATN800 \/ ATN801","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eNorix Attenda Wardrobe\u003c\/strong\u003e gives residents a place to hang and store clothing in behavioral health and other intensive-use settings. It is molded from high-impact polyethylene, filled with rigid polyurethane foam, and bolts securely to the wall with six connection points. A molded-in J-channel holds clothes hangers without creating a tie-off point.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoose the open ATN800 with no door, or the ATN801 with a door on a 270° continuous piano hinge that lets it fold flat to the side. The ATN801 comes with a left or right hinge and either a wing latch or a key lock, and the door can be reversed in the field.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rotationally molded high-impact polyethylene with UV stabilizers, filled with rigid polyurethane foam\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rounded corners and a sloped top\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eClothes Hanging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Molded-in J-channel for hangers\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDoor (ATN801):\u003c\/strong\u003e 270° continuous piano hinge, left or right hinge, wing latch or key lock, field reversible\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOverall Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 26” W × 24” D × 78.4” H (no door) or 25.5” D (with door)\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 75 lbs (no door), 80 lbs (with door)\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eColors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Twilight, Cove, Sand, Sienna, Dove\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlammability Standards:\u003c\/strong\u003e California Technical Bulletin 133 and 117, UL 1056, ASTM E1537, and NFPA 261\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEnvironmental Certification:\u003c\/strong\u003e GREENGUARD and GREENGUARD Gold\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWarranty:\u003c\/strong\u003e 10-year limited replacement warranty\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIntended Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Indoor use only\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCountry of Manufacture:\u003c\/strong\u003e USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Models and Options\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eATN800 – No Door:\u003c\/strong\u003e 75 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eATN801-RL – Right Hinge, Wing Latch:\u003c\/strong\u003e 80 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eATN801-RK – Right Hinge, Key Lock:\u003c\/strong\u003e 80 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eATN801-LL – Left Hinge, Wing Latch:\u003c\/strong\u003e 80 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eATN801-LK – Left Hinge, Key Lock:\u003c\/strong\u003e 80 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstallation and Options\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWall-Mounted Installation:\u003c\/strong\u003e Bolts to a solid wall with six connection points. Anchors are required and are not supplied by Norix. The bottom and back surfaces have a channel for security caulk (caulk not supplied).\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAssembly:\u003c\/strong\u003e None required\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Norix Attenda Wardrobe gives residents secure clothing storage in rooms where safety, durability, and easy cleaning are important considerations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTypical applications include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eBehavioral healthcare facilities and psychiatric hospitals\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eCorrectional and detention facilities\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eOther supervised residential and institutional settings\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore Anchortex's \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/bh-behavioral-healthcare-furniture\"\u003eBehavioral Healthcare Anti-Ligature Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/cd-correctional-furniture\"\u003ePrison and Detention Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e collections for more institutional furniture.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAbout Norix Attenda Molded Bedroom Series\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Norix Attenda Series is a line of molded bedroom furniture for behavioral healthcare and correctional facilities. It includes beds, nightstands, open chests, desks, a stool, wall-mounted storage units, and a wardrobe, all molded from high-impact polyethylene in a clean, contemporary style. Each piece is designed to attach flush to the wall or floor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCommon characteristics of the Attenda Series include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMolded Construction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rotationally molded high-impact polyethylene with smooth, rounded edges\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLigature-Resistant Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Molded shapes without pass-throughs or tie-off points to help reduce ligature risk\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eContraband-Resistant Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e No creases or nooks, which helps reduce places to hide contraband\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Cleaning:\u003c\/strong\u003e Chemically resistant surfaces that can be cleaned with bleach solutions and hospital-grade disinfectants\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTruColor™ Technology:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully compounded color for a consistent finish without streaks or speckles\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAbout Norix Furniture\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNorix manufactures durable furniture for demanding environments, including behavioral healthcare facilities, psychiatric hospitals, correctional institutions, and residential treatment centers. Explore the full line of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/norix-furniture\"\u003eNorix Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e at Anchortex.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Norix","product_type":"","created_at":"2021-01-29T13:18:33-05:00","handle":"norix-attenda-wardrobe","updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:27:41-05:00","published_at":"2021-01-29T13:18:33-05:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"Behavioral Healthcare Furniture, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-patient-rooms, cd-furn-cell, norix-attenda, Prison-Furniture","variants":[{"id":37961016541372,"product_id":6236193194172,"title":"ATN800 - No Door","price":"1674.40","sku":"N700194-01","position":1,"compare_at_price":"2093.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"ATN800 - No Door","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2021-01-29T13:18:34-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:27:41-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"-","grams":34019,"image_id":null,"weight":75.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":37961016574140,"product_id":6236193194172,"title":"ATN801-RL - Right Hinge - Latch","price":"2214.40","sku":"N700194-02","position":2,"compare_at_price":"2768.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"ATN801-RL - Right Hinge - Latch","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2021-01-29T13:18:34-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:27:41-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"-","grams":36287,"image_id":null,"weight":80.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping"